{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113220","id":3049455950,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc61wwFO","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113220","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113220.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113220.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113220","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113220/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113220/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113220/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/047e0e060604204b335a98b021c6a4e7777d52b1","number":113220,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix GLES3 `buffer_free_data` error","user":{"login":"xuhuisheng","id":1118508,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMTg1MDg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1118508?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng","html_url":"https://github.com/xuhuisheng","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"- *Fix https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111678*\r\n\r\n## Issue Description\r\n\r\nIn <https://github.com/100-Devs-1-Game/Sixwaystosuffer>, there is an error message: `Condition \"!buffer_allocs_cache.has(p_id)\" is true.` \r\n\r\nI found the `surface.vertex_buffers[1]` equals 0, while `surface.vertex_buffers[0]` is not 0. So `utilities::buffer_free_data()` will report zero is invalid.\r\n\r\nBut the `Sixwaystosuffer` game is too complicated, I cannot location the accuracy causing. The calling chain is as follows:\r\n\r\n- `RendererSceneCull::free()`\r\n- `RendererSceneCull::instance_set_base()`\r\n- `RSG::mesh_storage->mesh_instance_free()`\r\n- `GLES3::MeshStorage::_mesh_instance_clear()`\r\n- `GLES3::MeshStorage::_mesh_instance_remove_surface()`\r\n- `GLES3::Utilities::get_singleton()->buffer_free_data()`\r\n\r\nLooks like we use `free()` to delete something, and there is no relevant `vertex_buffers[1]`, then error message occurred.\r\n\r\nAnd I try to find what the `vertex_buffers[1]` used to do from blaming. It may come from https://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/8fef9a689e0016b1bcdcf08ba2e10bae30e464de#diff-1f7a5159492d9002eb9f6652b5f8e8712fbc4d279738b77d77cf3e3aa96f2eaa\r\n\r\n```diff\r\n\t\tif (mesh->blend_shape_count > 0) {\r\n\t\t\t// Ping-Pong buffers for processing blendshapes.\r\n-\t\t\tglGenBuffers(2, s.vertex_buffers);\r\n+\t\t\tglGenBuffers(2, s.blend_shape_vertex_buffers);\r\n```\r\n\r\nIt renamed `vertex_buffers` to `blend_shape_vertex_buffers`. But, I cannot confirm whether it is the reason.\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_k